WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:04.504
WE'RE GETTING AN ANNOUNCEMENT
FROM ATTORNEY GENERAL MERRICK

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.874
GARLAND SET TO APPOINT A SPECIAL
COUNSEL IN THE TRUMP PROBE.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:11.277
