SO IN THE NEXT 20 MINUTES OR SO

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.680
WE'RE GOING TO HEAR FROM THE
ATTORNEY GENERAL DIRECTLY, BUT

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:18.318
HE IS -- HE HAS APPOINTED A
SPECIAL COUNSEL TO OVERSEE THE

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:20.954
INVESTIGATION -- THE TWIN
INVESTIGATIONS INTO THE FORMER

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:25.125
PRESIDENT, ONE OF THEM OF COURSE
IS THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT'S

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:28.161
INVESTIGATION OF THE RETENTION
OF NATIONAL SECURITY INFORMATION

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.231
THESE ARE THE CLASSIFIED
DOCUMENTS THAT WERE FOUND BY THE

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:35.735
FBI DURING THE SEARCH AT THE
FORMER PRESIDENT'S RESIDENCE IN

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:38.938
PALM BEACH IN MAR-A-LAGO, THE
SECOND PART OF THIS IS PARTS OF

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.609
THE JANUARY 6th INVESTIGATION
THAT TOUCH ON THE FORMER

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:45.111
PRESIDENT.
OF COURSE, YOU KNOW THAT ONE OF

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.581
THE THINGS THE JUSTICE
DEPARTMENT HAS BEEN LOOKING INTO

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.851
IS THE INVOLVEMENT OF THE FORMER
PRESIDENT AND THE PEOPLE AROUND

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:55.989
HIM IN THE EFFORT TO OBSTRUCT
THE TRANSFER OF POWER AFTER

00:00:55.989 --> 00:01:03.029
THE -- AFTER THE 2020 ELECTION.
HE WAS INVOLVED IN THE FAKE

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:07.233
ELECTORS SCHEME AND IN THE
ENTIRE EFFORT TO TRY TO PREVENT

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:11.104
CONGRESS FROM CERTIFYING JOE
BIDEN'S VICTORY AT THE END OF

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.106
THE 2020 ELECTION.
THOSE ARE THE TWO THINGS THAT

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:16.676
THE SPECIAL COUNSEL WHO HAS
ALREADY BEEN APPOINTED BY THE

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:19.779
ATTORNEY GENERAL WHO IS NOW
GOING TO OVERSEE THOSE TWO SEE

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.714
ASPECTS OF THESE TWO
INVESTIGATIONS.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:25.485
NOW, WE'RE GOING TO HEAR A
LITTLE BIT MORE ABOUT WHO THE

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:28.621
ATTORNEY GENERAL HAS APPOINTED
WHEN THE ATTORNEY GENERAL COMES

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:33.226
OUT TO SPEAK, AGAIN, IN ABOUT 30
MINUTES OR SO AND WE'RE GOING TO

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:38.831
HEAR A LOT MORE ABOUT EXACTLY
WHY THIS WAS DONE, BUT, LOOK, WE

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:42.936
PREVIOUSLY REPORTED WE BROKE THE
STORY HERE AT CNN THAT THIS WAS

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.572
SOMETHING THAT WAS IN DISCUSSION
AT THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT AND

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:51.211
PART OF THE CALCULATION WAS THE
IDEA THAT, YOU KNOW, HAVING

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:54.447
SOMEONE NOT PART OF THE
POLITICAL LEADERSHIP HERE UNDER

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:58.384
THE POLITICAL LEADERSHIP HERE
OVERSEEING THESE INVESTIGATIONS

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:02.689
WAS IMPORTANT IF THE FORMER
PRESIDENT DECLARES THAT HE IS A

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:05.792
CANDIDATE FOR OFFICE ONCE MORE,
GIVEN THE FACT THAT OBVIOUSLY HE

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:11.564
MIGHT BE RUNNING AGAINST MERRICK
GARLAND, THE ATTORNEY GENERAL'S

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:14.534
BOSS, JOE BIDEN, IF HE DECIDES
TO RUN FOR REELECTION SO THAT'S

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:19.272
PART OF THE ISSUE, WHICH WAS TO
TRY TO INSULATE THOSE TWO

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.574
INVESTIGATIONS AND KEEP THEM OUT
OF THE REALM OF POLITICS.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:25.812
OF COURSE, YOU GUYS KNOW THAT,
YOU KNOW, YOU CAN TRY TO DO

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:29.249
THAT, BUT THEN OF COURSE IT HAS
TO DO WITH DONALD TRUMP AND

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:32.318
THERE'S PROBABLY NO WAY TO
DIVORCE YOURSELF ENTIRELY FROM

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.354
THE POLITICAL ATMOSPHERE OF
THIS.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:37.657
&gt;&gt; EVAN, STAY WITH ME I WANT TO
BRING IN JESSICA SCHNEIDER WHO

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:43.463
IS LEARNING MORE ABOUT THE S
DELIBERATIONS THAT TOOK PLACE TO

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:45.898
GET TO THIS POINT.
&gt;&gt; AS EVAN JUST MENTIONED HERE

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:50.036
IT WAS OUR TEAM TWO WEEKS AGO
THAT BROKE THAT NEWS THAT THE

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:53.172
DOJ WAS CONSIDERING WHETHER OR
NOT A SPECIAL COUNSEL WOULD BE

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:56.442
NECESSARY ONCE TRUMP ANNOUNCED
HIS CANDIDACY FOR A SECOND TERM.

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:59.646
OF COURSE, THAT ANNOUNCEMENT
HAPPENING EARLIER THIS WEEK ON

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.847
TUESDAY NIGHT.
SO PRESUMABLY THE DEPARTMENT OF

00:03:01.847 --> 00:03:04.717
JUSTICE, THE ATTORNEY GENERAL
ACTING FAIRLY QUICKLY HERE

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:08.454
WITHIN A MATTER OF DAYS TO
DECIDE TO NAME A SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:13.626
TO OVERSEE THESE TWO PARALLEL
AND VERY BIG PROBES THAT ARE

00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:17.864
ONGOING, INTO JANUARY 6th AND
ALSO THE ALLEGED RETENTION OF

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:20.767
CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS AT THE
FORMER PRESIDENT'S HOME IN PALM

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:23.536
BEACH, FLORIDA, MAR-A-LAGO.
SO THIS HAS BEEN SOMETHING THAT

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:29.309
THE DOJ HAS BEEN CONSIDERING FOR
MANY WEEKS, AS ALL OF THESE

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:32.178
INVESTIGATIONS HAVE REALLY
CRESCENDOED AND THAT

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:34.714
ANNOUNCEMENT WILL BE COMING
TODAY FROM THE ATTORNEY GENERAL

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:36.983
MERRICK GARLAND.
EVAN TALKED A LITTLE BIT ABOUT A

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:40.486
SPECIAL COUNSEL, THE FACT THAT
IT CAN SOMEWHAT INSULATE THE

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:44.290
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE FROM ANY
CRIES OF POLITICIZATION HERE.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:48.828
OF COURSE, THOSE CRIES ARE GOING
TO COME INEVITABLY.

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:51.264
BUT ULTIMATELY WHAT'S IMPORTANT
TO NOTE HERE IS THAT EVEN THOUGH

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:53.866
THE SPECIAL COUNSEL WILL BE
NAMED VERY SHORTLY BY THE

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:57.270
ATTORNEY GENERAL, HE WILL REVEAL
WHO IT IS, THAT SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.606
WILL OPERATE INDEPENDENTLY,
HOWEVER, ULTIMATELY ANY

00:04:00.606 --> 00:04:03.109
DECISIONS ABOUT WHETHER TO
CHARGE THE FORMER PRESIDENT,

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:06.245
DONALD TRUMP, OR ANY OF HIS
ASSOCIATES, THAT'S SOMETHING

00:04:06.245 --> 00:04:11.684
THAT WILL, IN FACT, BE RUN BY
AND APPROVED ULTIMATELY BY THE

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:15.054
ATTORNEY GENERAL AND TOP
OFFICIALS AT THE JUSTICE

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:16.756
DEPARTMENT.
OF COURSE, THE UNITED STATES

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:22.528
PUBLIC HAS SEEN THIS BEFORE, WE
SAW ROBERT MUELLER BE NAMED AS

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:26.132
