ATTORNEY GENERAL ROD ROSENSTEIN,

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:31.270
THAT WAS WAY BACK IN 2017.
WE SAW THAT PROBE ONGOING FOR AT

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:33.406
LEAST A YEAR AND A HALF, I
BELIEVE.

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:37.110
AND THEN OF COURSE WE STILL HAVE
A SPECIAL COUNSEL, JOHN DURHAM,

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.714
WHO HAS BEEN ONGOING AND
ACTUALLY UNSUCCESSFUL IN SEVERAL

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:42.949
PROSECUTIONS THAT HE HAS
BROUGHT.

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:45.785
SO THIS WILL BE A SPECIAL
COUNSEL THAT WILL BE ANNOUNCED

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:49.722
BY THE ATTORNEY GENERAL, WE ARE
EXPECTING THAT LIVE ANNOUNCEMENT

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:53.259
