EXPLAIN THE PARAMETERS OF THIS

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.899
INVESTIGATION AND WHAT HE WILL
BE OVERSEEING.

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:05.104
BUT, ANA, IT WILL BE QUITE BROAD
BECAUSE OBVIOUSLY THESE TWO

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:08.374
PARALLEL TRACKS INTO THE
PRESIDENT'S -- FORMER

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:11.010
PRESIDENT'S INVOLVEMENT IN
JANUARY 6, TRYING TO OVERTURN

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.714
THE 2020 ELECTION AND THEN OF
COURSE THAT CONTINUING

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:17.250
INVESTIGATION THAT POPPED UP
